            "arabic_text": "عَنْهُ عَنْ عَلِيِّ بْنِ أَسْبَاطٍ عَنْ عَمِّهِ يَعْقُوبَ الْأَحْمَرِ عَنْ أَبِي بَصِيرٍ عَنْ أَبِي عَبْدِ اللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ قَالَ",
            "chunk_type": "isnad",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "From him, from ʿAlī ibn Asbāṭ, from his uncle Yaʿqūb al-Aḥmar, from Abī Baṣīr, from Abī ʿAbdillāh عليه السلام, who said:",
              "es": "",
              "fa": "",
              "fr": "",
              "id": "",
              "ru": "",
              "tr": "",
              "ur": "",
              "zh": ""
            },
            "word_end": 19,
            "word_start": 0
          },
          {
            "arabic_text": "سُئِلَ عَنْ رَجُلٍ أَصَابَ مِنِ امْرَأَتِهِ ثُمَّ حَاضَتْ قَبْلَ أَنْ تَغْتَسِلَ، قَالَ: «تَجْعَلُهُ غُسْلًا وَاحِدًا».",
            "chunk_type": "body",
            "translations": {
              "bn": "",
              "de": "",
              "en": "He was asked about a man who had relations with his wife, then she menstruated before performing ghusl (ritual bath). He said: “She makes it one ghusl (ritual bath).”",
              "es": "",
              "fa": "",
              "fr": "",
              "id": "",
              "ru": "",
              "tr": "",
              "ur": "",
              "zh": ""
            },
            "word_end": 34,
